# Gateway API key for the Coding Hermes fleet scheduler.
#
# Install as /etc/coding-hermes/gateway.env (or ~/.config/coding-hermes/ for
# user-level installs) with mode 0600 — the scheduler systemd unit loads it
# via EnvironmentFile and the daemon's --gateway-key flag defaults to
# $API_SERVER_KEY (cmd/schedulerd/main.go). NEVER pass the key on the
# command line: argv is world-readable via `ps aux`.
#
#   API_SERVER_KEY=<your key here>
